<div id="LST1.6" class="ltx_listing ltx_lstlisting ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing"><div class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64," download="sections/appendix/cases/qa/success_untruthful.md">⬇</a></div>
