<div id="lstnumberx38" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx38.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">Here</span><span id="lstnumberx38.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">’</span><span id="lstnumberx38.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">s</span><span id="lstnumberx38.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx38.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">the</span><span id="lstnumberx38.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx38.7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">most</span><span id="lstnumberx38.8" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx38.9" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">possible</span><span id="lstnumberx38.10" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx38.11" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">answer</span><span id="lstnumberx38.12" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">:</span><span id="lstnumberx38.13" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx38.14" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-bg-color:#C4EA70;">Let’s think step by step. The film starring Nicolas Cage and Tea Leoni is The Family Man. The screenwriters for The Family Man are David Diamond and David Weissman. David Weissman has credits for "Evolution". So the answer is: David Weissman.</span>
</div>
