writer">ratio</span><span id="lstnumberx81.23" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">,</span><span id="lstnumberx81.24" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx81.25" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">Badly</span><span id="lstnumberx81.26" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx81.27" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">Drawn</span><span id="lstnumberx81.28" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx81.29" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">Boy</span><span id="lstnumberx81.30" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx81.31" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">or</span><span id="lstnumberx81.32" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx81.33" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">Wolf</span><span id="lstnumberx81.34" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx81.35" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">Alice</span><span id="lstnumberx81.36" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">?</span>
