</div>
<div id="lstnumberx458" class="ltx_listingline">
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx459" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx459.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-bg-color:#C4EA70;">You all know about the Darwin Awards - it’s the annual honor given to the person who did the best job of removing himself from the gene pool - a fellow in Belgium was killed.</span>
</div>
