<section id="A6.SS1.SSS3" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">F.1.3 </span><span id="A6.SS1.SSS3.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">CRITIC</span> </h4>

<div id="A6.SS1.SSS3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A6.SS1.SSS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We use similar <span id="A6.SS1.SSS3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">CRITIC</span> prompts for the three different free-form question answering datasets, except that the seed questions are sampled from each dataset. Here are the example prompts:</p>
</div>
<figure id="LST19" class="ltx_float ltx_lstlisting">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float">Listing 19: </span>Prompts for <span id="LST19.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">CRITIC</span> on question answering. <span id="LST19.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">CRITIC</span> w/o Tool uses the same prompt.</figcaption>
<div id="LST19.6" class="ltx_listing ltx_lstlisting ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing"><div class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64," download="sections/appendix/prompts/qa_critic.md">⬇</a></div>
