<section id="A6.SS2.SSS2" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">F.2.2 </span><span id="A6.SS2.SSS2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">CRITIC</span> </h4>

<div id="A6.SS2.SSS2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A6.SS2.SSS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Here we present the full prompts of <span id="A6.SS2.SSS2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">CRITIC</span> for GSM8k. <span id="A6.SS2.SSS2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">CRITIC</span> w/o Tool uses a similar prompt as <span id="A6.SS2.SSS2.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">CRITIC</span> by simply removing the “Execution” and “Output” information from the <span id="A6.SS2.SSS2.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">CRITIC</span> prompts.</p>
</div>
<figure id="LST21" class="ltx_float ltx_lstlisting">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float">Listing 21: </span>Prompts for <span id="LST21.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">CRITIC</span> on mathematical program synthesis.</figcaption>
<div id="LST21.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_lstlisting ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing"><div class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64," download="sections/appendix/prompts/gsm8k_critic.md">⬇</a></div>
<div id="lstnumberx920" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx920.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">Question</span><span id="lstnumberx920.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">:</span><span id="lstnumberx920.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx920.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">Janet</span><span id="lstnumberx920.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx920.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">hires</span><span id="lstnumberx920.7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx920.8" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">six</span><span id="lstnumberx920.9" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx920.10" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">employees</span><span id="lstnumberx920.11" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">.</span><span id="lstnumberx920.12" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx920.13" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">Four</span><span id="lstnumberx920.14" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx920.15" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">of</span><span id="lstnumberx920.16" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx920.17" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">them</span><span id="lstnumberx920.18" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx920.19" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">are</span><span id="lstnumberx920.20" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx920.21" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">warehouse</span><span id="lstnumberx920.22" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typ